er enters using a space that was released and allocated temporarily, what should happen to the temporary claimant’s authorization?\",\n  \"answer\": \"Treat the permanent holder’s detected entry as use of that space, cancel the temporary allocation, and deny the temporary claimant authorization for that space.\",\n  \"by\": \"Hamza (via web)\"\n }\n]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"assumptions\" kind=\"assumptions\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"notifications\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q4\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-4\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-1\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should the app notify eligible employees when parking becomes available, given that native push notifications are out of scope? → assumed: Email only, from fixed templates; no SMS or push.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q6\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-2\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What entrance LPR camera and indicator-light integration is available for the app to use? → assumed: Integrate with the existing camera and indicator through their supported interfaces.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q7\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-5\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-3\",\n  \"risk\": \"high\",\n  \"text\": \"What should security do if the camera, plate recognition, network, or indicator fails during a temporary-authorization check? → assumed: Keep the automatic authorization indicator off and hold the vehicle for an approved manual verification process.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"reporting\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q8\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-6\"\n  ],\n  \"id\": \"ASM-4\",\n  \"risk\": \"low\",\n  \"text\": \"How should “overall parking utilization percentage” be calculated in the weekly report? → assumed: On-screen lists with filters and CSV export; no custom report builder.\"\n },\n {\n  \"fromDefault\": \"languages\",\n  \"fromQuestion\": \"Q10\",\n  \"fromSpan\": [\n   \"I-1\",\n   \"I-2\",\n   \"I-3\",\n   \"I-4\",\n   \"I-5